{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7b2e7ff7-ee55-8d89-ac77-67fec926ffbc",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T12:22:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Beverly Wilcox",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:18:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:18:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, good afternoon. My name is Beverly Wilcox. I am calling about the water on my street. It is near the storm drain and I am quite concerned."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:18:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. Wilcox. Where is the street, and what's the number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:18:43-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 107 Annandale Road, in the North End. After the nor'easter last weekend, Saturday into Sunday, the street in front of my house turned into a pond. It is still there today, Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:18:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still standing water, two days after the storm. Okay. Is it deep? Is traffic going through it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:19:04-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. Cars go through and they throw wakes, like small boats. On the other hand, nobody slows down, so the water goes toward the yard. I am afraid of what it will do to the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:19:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Is it getting into the house, or just the street and the yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:19:25-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For now only the street and the edge of the lawn. On the other hand, it is very close to the step. And there is one more thing. There is a manhole cover in the road that looks off by an inch. It sits higher than the pavement on one side, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:19:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A manhole cover that's sitting up about an inch on one side. Is that in the middle of the pond, or off to the side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:19:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at the edge of the water, nearer to my side of the road. I could see it when a car passed and the water moved. I would not walk close to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:20:11-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, stay away from it. I'll write that up for the crew so they look at both the drain and the cover. Let me read it back. 107 Annandale Road, North End, standing water in the street since the weekend storm, cars throwing wakes, and a manhole cover that looks about an inch off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:20:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is exactly right. Thank you. On the other hand, if you need to reach me, my number is 401-555-0166."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:20:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0166. Got it. Is that your cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:20:46-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is my cell. I also have a small problem. I tried to reset my email password, and it sent the code to an old number. So email will not work for me. Please use the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:21:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, we'll call you. Do you want me to note anything about when is good?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:21:09-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Any time is fine. I would like a call back when it is done, please, so I know the crew came and what they found."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:21:20-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in a request for a call back once the work is finished. I can't tell you exactly when they'll get there, since they're busy with a lot of drains after the storm, but this one has a possible safety issue with the cover, so I'll flag that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:21:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. On the other hand, I hope it is soon, because the forecast, I think, says more rain later in the week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:21:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. If the water starts coming toward the house, or the cover moves or sinks, call us right back, or call 911 if someone's in danger."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:22:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will. Thank you very much, Lorraine. You have been very patient with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:22:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Wilcox. Take care, and we'll be in touch."
    }
  ],
